Reading this I am feeling urged to take the side of the adventurer,
now, to propose (once again after some years of pause) that the hero
shall get information about the visible monster weapons and armoring.
Enchantments shall not be visible of course, or maybe visible if you
are zapping e.g. a wand probing against the monsters. But the hero
should be able to make a clear judgement about which monsters in a
horde should be attacked first (because it's the least armored or
because it uses the most frightening weapon), or to judge in advance
whether to flee or not. The information should be available through
the '/' command as long as the monster is in line of sight (not if
seen by ESP etc.). (Currently one can see the weapons used only in
the special case that the monster switches weapon or parts of armor.)

